            "review_title": "Review at Nha Trang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Trần R\n11 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely recomnended!!\nMay 2023 • Friends\nSeafood Pizza is delicious and worthful, staff is so friendly and kind, French Chicken is brand new dish in Nha Trang, it's a must try and best seller here. Absolutely recomnended!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 13, 2023\nMKT\nDear tr_nr2023,\n\nThank you very much for your review. We are happy that you had a nice experience at our Nha Trang restaurant. We offer variety of food, from local to international food to match everyone's favor. Embark on an adventure of taste with a buffet for breakfast, à la carte or set menu for lunch and dinner. We do hope to welcome you back to our restaurant soon.\n\nWish you all the best.\n\nBest regards,\nNha Trang restaurant team\nRead more\nWritten June 19, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
